@startuml
title SIGMAVITAL - Deployment View

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

node "Client Device" as client {
  artifact "Web Browser" as browser
}

node "Application Server" as app {
  artifact "SIGMAVITAL Web Application" as webapp
  artifact "Application Controllers" as controllers
  artifact "GestionServicioFacade" as facade
  artifact "Domain Components" as domain
}

node "Database Server" as dbserver {
  database "SIGMAVITAL Relational Database" as database
}

browser --> webapp : HTTPS / TCP 443 (proposed)
webapp --> controllers : Application interaction
controllers --> facade : Workflow coordination
facade --> domain : Domain operations
domain --> database : MariaDB/MySQL / TCP 3306 (proposed)

note right of client
  User interface access
  through a web browser
end note

note right of app
  Application logic,
  workflow coordination
  and domain processing
end note

note right of dbserver
  Persistent storage
  and data integrity
end note

@enduml
